	(text "J5 has the pin order of the PPK2 logic port: pin 1 VCC, pin 2 ground, pins 3 to 10 are logic inputs 7 down to 0.\nU29 port B is powered through JP2: from VOUT_BUF as built, so the inputs follow the DUT supply,\nor from the VCC pin of the port for a DUT whose logic runs on another voltage (1.65 V to 5.5 V).\nDIR and OE are referenced to port A (+3V3_C): DIR low sets the direction B to A.\nWith port B unpowered the outputs float; pull-downs on the Side Data sheet hold DIN0 to DIN7.\nEach input loads the DUT pin with 1 M to ground."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
